# Gold Portfolio Tracker Backend – Project Specification

Use this document as the single source of truth. Do not assume; verify against this spec.

---

## 1. Project Overview

- **Type:** Backend REST API
- **Runtime:** Node.js (v20+)
- **Purpose:** Track physical gold investments (Buy & Sell) using real-time data and calculate profit/loss.

**Core Flow:**
1. User logs in via Google (OAuth) → receives JWT token.
2. User records transactions: **BUY** or **SELL**.
3. System validates that the user has enough gold to sell.
4. System calculates **Net Portfolio** with FIFO cost basis.

