## 6. API Endpoints

### A. Authentication (`/auth`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/auth/google` | Initiate Google OAuth |
| GET | `/auth/google/callback` | OAuth callback, issues JWT |
| GET | `/auth/me` | Get current user (requires Bearer token) |

**JWT Payload:** `{ userId, email, name }`
**Token Expiry:** 7 days

### B. Gold Prices (`/api/prices`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/prices` | Get all gold prices |
| GET | `/api/prices?refresh=true` | Force refresh (bypass cache) |
| GET | `/api/prices/:goldType` | Get specific gold type price |

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "prices": {
      "gram": { "id": 1, "name": "Gram Altın", "buyPrice": 7025, "sellPrice": 7085 },
      "ceyrek": { "id": 2, "name": "Çeyrek Altın", "buyPrice": 11774, "sellPrice": 12014 },
      "yarim": { "id": 3, "name": "Yarım Altın", "buyPrice": 23549, "sellPrice": 24029 },
      "cumhuriyet": { "id": 4, "name": "Cumhuriyet Altını", "buyPrice": 48462, "sellPrice": 48952 }
    },
    "lastUpdated": "2026-02-09T18:45:30.974Z",
    "source": "altin.in"
  }
}
```

### C. Transactions (`/api/transactions`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/transactions` | Create transaction (BUY/SELL) |
| GET | `/api/transactions` | List all user transactions |
| GET | `/api/transactions/holdings` | Get holdings summary |
| GET | `/api/transactions/:id` | Get specific transaction |
| DELETE | `/api/transactions/:id` | Delete transaction |

**POST Body:**
```json
{
  "type": "BUY" | "SELL",
  "goldType": "gram" | "ceyrek" | "yarim" | "cumhuriyet",
  "quantity": 10,
  "pricePerUnit": 7000,
  "date": "2026-02-09"
}
```

**SELL Validation:** If `currentHoldings < quantity` → **400** `"Insufficient gold balance"`

### D. Portfolio (`/api/portfolio`)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/portfolio` | Get portfolio summary with P/L |

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "totalPortfolioValue": 71018.18,
    "totalCost": 70000,
    "totalUnrealizedProfitLoss": 1018.18,
    "totalRealizedProfit": 0,
    "assets": [
      {
        "goldType": "gram",
        "netQuantity": 10,
        "averageCost": 7000,
        "totalCost": 70000,
        "currentPrice": 7101.82,
        "currentValue": 71018.18,
        "unrealizedProfitLoss": 1018.18,
        "realizedProfit": 0
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Cost Basis:** FIFO (First In, First Out)

